    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Mouse Practice For Kids\u2019  helps young children learn how to use a PC mouse by clicking on colorful fruits that appear on the screen.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214720/extras/1a9cb50f4968b4ea82f2d149ed930c3a.avif?t=1743584420\" data-has-big width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With cheerful music and rewarding sound effects, \u2018Mouse Practice for Kids\u2019 provides a joyful experience while improving fine motor skills. Perfect for parents looking for an engaging and educational activity for their little ones.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214720/extras/deecb49739971f3c4f18f34a11dfbc7f.poster.avif?t=1743584420\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214720/extras/deecb49739971f3c4f18f34a11dfbc7f.webp?t=1743584420\" class=\"bb_img\" width=300 height=300 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Educational Focus:</strong> Helps kids develop mouse control skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Gameplay:</strong> Click on colorful fruits and vegetables as they appear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parental Control Timer:</strong> Set a time limit for gameplay; the game automatically shuts down when time is up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Difficulty:</strong> Mouse cursor shrinks as levels advance, while fruits move and become smaller, adding more challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cheerful Feedback:</strong> Fun music and sound effects reward progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main feature of the game is a psychological trick, where the mouse cursor and fruits are initially large, encouraging kids to focus on moving the mouse and clicking on the fruit. As they progress through the levels, both the cursor and the fruits gradually decrease in size until the cursor reaches its normal PC size.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214720/extras/2049c3ac21ec9a7d140e829f71e2ff34.poster.avif?t=1743584420\" width=616 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214720/extras/2049c3ac21ec9a7d140e829f71e2ff34.webm?t=1743584420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214720/extras/2049c3ac21ec9a7d140e829f71e2ff34.mp4?t=1743584420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Mouse Practice For Kids\u2019  helps young children learn how to use a PC mouse by clicking on colorful fruits that appear on the screen.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214720/extras/1a9cb50f4968b4ea82f2d149ed930c3a.avif?t=1743584420\" data-has-big width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With cheerful music and rewarding sound effects, \u2018Mouse Practice for Kids\u2019 provides a joyful experience while improving fine motor skills. Perfect for parents looking for an engaging and educational activity for their little ones.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214720/extras/deecb49739971f3c4f18f34a11dfbc7f.poster.avif?t=1743584420\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214720/extras/deecb49739971f3c4f18f34a11dfbc7f.webp?t=1743584420\" class=\"bb_img\" width=300 height=300 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Educational Focus:</strong> Helps kids develop mouse control skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Gameplay:</strong> Click on colorful fruits and vegetables as they appear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parental Control Timer:</strong> Set a time limit for gameplay; the game automatically shuts down when time is up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Difficulty:</strong> Mouse cursor shrinks as levels advance, while fruits move and become smaller, adding more challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cheerful Feedback:</strong> Fun music and sound effects reward progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main feature of the game is a psychological trick, where the mouse cursor and fruits are initially large, encouraging kids to focus on moving the mouse and clicking on the fruit. As they progress through the levels, both the cursor and the fruits gradually decrease in size until the cursor reaches its normal PC size.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214720/extras/2049c3ac21ec9a7d140e829f71e2ff34.poster.avif?t=1743584420\" width=616 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214720/extras/2049c3ac21ec9a7d140e829f71e2ff34.webm?t=1743584420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214720/extras/2049c3ac21ec9a7d140e829f71e2ff34.mp4?t=1743584420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
